window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Games, undercover costumes, and evil tech lairs.</b></p> <p>Gerri Wilder and the Matchmaker's Book Club are at it again, meddling with the best of intentions. With romance novels and a keen eye for potential, these matchmaking mamas have their sights set on pairing two stubborn gamers with their perfect matches... each other!</p> <p>Brianne Ellis is a 34-year-old game writer who'd rather battle bosses in her favorite RPG than navigate the dating world. She's perfectly content with her virtual adventures... until she meets a tall, brooding bear shifter who promises thrills she can't find on any screen.</p> <p>Reid Parker, bear shifter and security mogul is tired of his mother's not-so-subtle nudges about finding his fated mate. Little does he know, fate and a bunch of matchmaking mamas have their sights on him. When Reid crosses paths with the beautiful, sarcastic, and funny Brianne, he knows his life is about to change.</p> <p>When Brianne's latest game prototype is stolen by a rogue group of gamers, Reid must prove he's more than just a powerful shifter with a knack for security. As they navigate through high-tech lairs, and underground gaming clubs, and face off against cunning thieves, their bond deepens into something neither of them anticipated. Can Reid keep Brianne safe from the dangers that lurk in the gaming underworld? And will Brianne realize that sometimes, love is the best adventure you never saw coming?</p> <p><i>Get ready for a laugh-out-loud, action-packed ride filled with steamy moments, cheeky banter, and a romance that levels up beyond their wildest dreams. This paranormal rom-com will have you cheering the matchmaking mamas and Brianne and Reid as they fight for justice, love, and the ultimate high score.</i></p>"; 
